# 8-Bit Music Box song
# Boccherini: La musica notturna delle strade di Madrid, Op. 30 No. 6 -
# V. Passa Calle (Allegro vivo): the violin-and-cello duet from the end of
# Master and Commander. Arranged for violin and cello from the flutetunes.com
# arrangement (imports/boccherini-...-passa-calle.mid): the flute melody on the
# violin; the strummed chords on the cello, low to high a tick apart; in the
# 18-bar introduction the violin plays the chords' top line. Its bars 1-40 and
# its final chord; the slower arpeggio coda that follows (a tempo change this
# format cannot store yet, DESIGN.md MB-2) is left out.
